#tutor08
From : Colonel K.Rorscham
       Vandaum Headquarters

For : % &
      Island of Piran

I was able to read your report in spite of your grammar
mistakes. It seems as if there is no doubt about the
supremacy of the medium sized tank on the battlefield.

You will be granted a powerfully armed warship for your
next operations. The admiral Harald Thorque is on his way
to bring you the plans of this new warship.

You will need them to conquer the Communist base that is
at BINIC to the NORTH of your base.

Be on your guard, one of our submarines has reported the
presence of Capitalist convoys in the region.

If you play cat and mouse, make sure you withhold the role
of the cat.